R3517 evidence - the ledger red was one stored line in the wrong shape
======================================================================

Question the board carried in: round R3514 committed work but "never wrote
a budget line", so seven os-ledger suites were red on rounds_without_ledger
= 3514 and the proposed fix was a named exemption.

1. Measured first, read-only
----------------------------
python src/os/ledger_lines.py --check
  lines total=134 window=134 kinds ledger=18 round=112 other=4
  rounds_without_ledger: 3514   VERDICT DIRTY

classify probe over the live window (in process, no writes):
  exactly ONE dated ledger-shaped line:
  2026-11-26 R3514 tokens: local=~30k api=0 api_reason=no cloud call: ...
  classify() -> "round"  because LEDGER_PREFIX_RE = ^R(\d{3,5}) tokens:
  LEDGER_PRESENCE_RE tolerates the date prefix, LEDGER_PREFIX_RE does not.

python src/os/repair_tokens_prefix_R2597.py --check   (before the change)
  {"verdict":"DIRTY","rounds":1,"detail":[{"round":"3514","items":[]}]}
  i.e. the door saw the missing budget line but had no candidate to heal -
  its only shape was a 'tokens:' line with no round label.

Conclusion: the line exists on disk. An exemption would have reported a
written budget line as never written, so none was added.

2. Change (two sites, both additive)
------------------------------------
src/os/repair_tokens_prefix_R2597.py
  - second shape: a line that reads as LEDGER_PRESENCE but not as
    LEDGER_PREFIX is a candidate; --apply strips ONLY ^YYYY-MM-DD\s+ and
    then requires the shipped classifier to read it as a ledger line.
  - AC-RTP7 (two arms) added to src/os/test_repair_tokens_prefix.py.

src/os/state_append.py
  - _ledger_dated() asks the two shipped regexes; --line payloads of that
    shape are refused by name E_RSA_LEDGER_DATE (rc=2, zero bytes, no temp
    file, hint names the repair door). --tokens/--round and a bare
    'R<n> tokens:' still land; a dated NON-ledger line still lands.
  - AC-RSA13 (three arms) added to src/os/test_state_append.py.

Registry counters moved with the criteria: reconcile_all.py and
state/suite-matrix.json declare os-ledger-tokens-prefix-repair 6 -> 8 and
os-state-append 12 -> 13.

3. Heal and read-back
---------------------
python src/os/repair_tokens_prefix_R2597.py --check
  {"verdict":"DIRTY","rounds":1,"detail":[{"round":"3514","items":[120]}]}
python src/os/repair_tokens_prefix_R2597.py --apply
  {"action":"apply","rounds":["3514"],"items":[120],"bytes":71220,
   "verdict":"REPAIRED"}
  one item differs, 11 bytes fewer ('2026-11-26 '), every key equal
python src/os/ledger_lines.py --check
  kinds ledger=19 round=111 other=4
  rounds_without_ledger: none  ledger_without_round: none
  baseline missing=0 orphan=0  VERDICT CLEAN

