5. Honest limits
----------------
- One stored log line was edited: its date prefix was removed and nothing
  else. No archive was touched and no other log line was rewritten.
- E_RTP_NOT_LEDGER and E_RTP_HAS_LEDGER are proved on repair() directly,
  because --apply's candidate set is closed by the shape law and a stale or
  hand-built findings list is the only way to reach them. Recorded rather
  than faked with an unreachable input.
- The battery page re-derivation was reported silent twice before; measured
  cause this round: piping the producer through Select-Object -Last buffers
  its whole output, so the runner sees zero bytes. Run it unpiped.
- The commit carries round R3516 as well, whose product work had been left
  uncommitted on the tree (state tick 3516, no commit).
- ZERO payment capability, no network beyond loopback. The five physical
  pieces (merchant id, server+domain+filing+ICP, miniprogram appid+secret,
  ...) still gate every buyer.
